You're talking.

00:33:49.460 --> 00:33:49.820
Absolutely.

00:33:53.860 --> 00:33:54.480
I found them asleep.

00:33:55.200 --> 00:33:58.520
When I told them to go back to work, they threw wet laundry in my face.

00:34:00.890 --> 00:34:04.770
You did, eh? Well, show them what it means to disobey my orders.

00:34:07.880 --> 00:34:08.120
Bye!

00:34:10.650 --> 00:34:12.450
Gee, I'm sure glad to get out of this joint.

00:34:12.610 --> 00:34:13.130
Me too.

00:34:13.650 --> 00:34:14.410
Have you got everything?

00:34:14.750 --> 00:34:15.070
Uh-huh.

00:34:15.600 --> 00:34:17.860
Now we'll go over to that competent guy and tell him we're through,

00:34:17.880 --> 00:34:20.420
and at the same time, I'll give him a piece of my mind.

00:34:20.540 --> 00:34:21.500
I don't blame you.

00:34:21.880 --> 00:34:23.000
Three cents a day.

00:34:23.310 --> 00:34:24.390
Ha! Left time!

00:34:33.230 --> 00:34:35.570
Turn out the guard and place them both under arrest.

00:34:35.830 --> 00:34:36.270
Yes, sir.

00:34:49.340 --> 00:34:51.080
What's the big idea of keeping us waiting?

00:34:56.390 --> 00:34:56.970
You know what?

00:34:57.150 --> 00:34:57.330
What?

00:34:57.490 --> 00:34:58.210
He's not here.

00:34:58.350 --> 00:34:59.550
Of course he's not here.

00:34:59.630 --> 00:34:59.970
Well, let's...

00:35:00.800 --> 00:35:02.580
Look nothing. Leave him a note.

00:35:03.570 --> 00:35:04.630
Don't bother to leave him a note.

00:35:05.020 --> 00:35:06.200
Just leave him a P.S.

00:35:06.580 --> 00:35:07.680
Good enough for him.

00:35:41.040 --> 00:35:43.180
he can put back in his pipe and smoke it.

00:35:44.100 --> 00:35:45.580
Maybe he doesn't smoke a pipe.

00:35:45.780 --> 00:35:47.320
Well, whatever, he smokes it.

00:35:47.620 --> 00:35:49.500
Well, you've got to be careful about those things.

00:36:12.060 --> 00:36:13.160
Just say in the note, Ollie.

00:36:13.360 --> 00:36:14.500
I said plenty.

00:36:14.600 --> 00:36:17.280
And if I could have spelled Raspberry, I'd have told him a lot more.

00:36:17.660 --> 00:36:18.560
That'll learn him.

00:36:18.780 --> 00:36:19.860
Three cents a day.

00:36:20.020 --> 00:36:20.260
Right.

00:36:41.390 --> 00:36:44.290
my army career have I been so grossly insulted.

00:36:45.160 --> 00:36:47.990
Just wait till I get my hands on him.

00:37:11.480 --> 00:37:11.760
I can't...

00:39:30.284 --> 00:39:30.704
Thank you.

00:39:31.004 --> 00:39:31.384
Goodbye.

00:39:34.924 --> 00:39:37.844
Let no one pass through that gate no matter what happens.

00:39:38.028 --> 00:39:39.028
Yes, sir.

00:39:45.580 --> 00:39:46.080
Come on.

00:39:47.852 --> 00:39:48.132
Satan.

00:39:48.428 --> 00:39:50.008
We're not going to take a plane, are we?

00:39:50.188 --> 00:39:51.548
I should say not.

00:40:05.210 --> 00:40:06.430
I wonder what keeps them up.

00:40:06.780 --> 00:40:09.240
I don't know, but I know what keeps me down.

00:40:11.070 --> 00:40:11.590
Me too.

00:40:11.900 --> 00:40:15.750
Good old terracotta for me any time, promiscuously.

00:40:29.220 --> 00:40:29.660
Josette.

00:40:33.260 --> 00:40:36.840
I'm so happy. At last, I'm here with you. Have you missed me?

00:40:36.920 --> 00:40:40.460
Every day has been a year, darling. I'll bring the car for you. Wait here just a moment.

00:40:46.660 --> 00:40:48.340
Could you tell us to wait at the railroad depot?

00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:58.300
