00:42:33.710 --> 00:42:37.230
Yes, I got your note, and when you signed it, you signed your own death warrant.

00:42:37.760 --> 00:42:39.280
You're under arrest for desertion.

00:42:39.700 --> 00:42:40.480
Now, fall in!

00:42:42.960 --> 00:42:45.640
Call them to the jail and have the guard to keep a close watch on them.

00:42:45.820 --> 00:42:46.300
Yes, sir!

00:42:46.850 --> 00:42:47.290
Fall in!

00:43:00.410 --> 00:43:05.420
Desserters! Desserters, eh? Come on, show you to your sweets.

00:43:30.120 --> 00:43:31.160
I'm sure not where to get off at.

00:43:34.090 --> 00:43:34.630
We do.

